28:T8a7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is a private driver in Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Each booking is quoted on its own, because the fare depends on the vehicle, the number of hours and the stops. Send the date, your hotel, the hours and the places you want to visit on WhatsApp and we reply with one fixed fare for the whole block, usually within 1–2 hours."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the driver wait while we pray?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The car waits at the nearest permitted point and you message when you are ready. Allow extra time at prayer times, when roads near the Haram close."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the car drive right up to the Haram?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Roads around Masjid al-Haram are restricted, and at prayer times they close to most traffic. The driver drops you at the nearest point the authorities allow and you walk the last part. If anyone in the group is elderly, tell us when you book so we plan the closest practical pickup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we do Ziyarat with the private driver?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. A half-day block covers the usual sites — Jabal al-Nour, Jabal Thawr, Mina, Muzdalifah and Arafat — with the car waiting at each stop. The driver provides transport only, not religious guidance. If you only want the set route, the Makkah Ziyarat page is the simpler booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we go to Jeddah and back in one day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Makkah to Jeddah is about 85 km each way. Book it as a full-day hire, or as a transfer there and a timed return — tell us the plan and we suggest the better option."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which cars are available with a driver in Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sedans such as the Toyota Camry, the Hyundai Staria and Mercedes V-Class for families, the GMC Yukon XL for seven with luggage, and the Toyota Hiace or Coaster for Umrah groups — all through our partner network. The exact car is confirmed for your date when we quote."}}]}1d:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C]","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/makkah/private-driver#service\",\"name\":\"Private Driver & Chauffeur Service in Makkah\",\"serviceType\":\"Hourly & full-day chauffeur hire\",\"description\":\"Hire a private driver in Makkah by the hour or for a full day — meetings, shopping, family errands and Ziyarat. Fare agreed before booking, 24/7.\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/makkah/private-driver\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Taxi Saudi Arabia\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Makkah\"},\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\",\"Arabic\"]}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/makkah/private-driver#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/makkah/private-driver\",\"speakable\":{\"@type\":\"SpeakableSpecification\",\"cssSelector\":[\"h1\",\"#speakable-summary\"]}}"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$28"}}]],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]
